== Usage ==
A '''Salt''' can be consumed by left-clicking it. Consuming a '''Salt''' grants temporary {{Stat|Charm Chance}}, depending on the type of '''Salt'''.

Unlike the various [[Lushlilac]] '''Salts''', [[Oceandy]]'s and [[Candycomb]]'s {{Stat|Charm Chance}} bonus stack with any [[Lushlilac]] '''Salt''' tier.

The duration of a '''Salt''' does not decrease while offline.

Several modifiers affect the effect of a '''Salt''':
*The [[Essence Shop#Forest|Tasty]] perk in the {{Item|Forest Essence}} shop increases {{Stat|Charm Chance}} from '''Salts''' by up to {{Green|10%}}.
*The {{Attr|Berry Mogul}} attribute, obtained from syphoning the {{Item|Fenlord Shard}}, increases the duration of '''Salts''' by {{Green|10%}}.

